{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17210","headline":"酬主客仲员外见贺正除 · 权德舆","name":"酬主客仲员外见贺正除","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五年承乏奉如纶，才薄那堪侍从臣。\n禁署独闻清漏晓，命书慙对紫泥新。\n周班每喜簪裾接，郢曲偏宜讽咏频。\n忆昔曲台尝议礼，见君论着最相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}